The '''Advent Stages''' (降臨ステージ ''Kōrin Sutēji'') are a group of time-limited stages that appear twice a month for two days each. All Advent Stages have a [[Stage Difficulties|difficulty]] of at least ★8, a [[:Category:Advent Bosses|unique boss]] and a [[No Continues]] restriction. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], they are unlocked after beating [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]].

Once encountered, the boss will be recorded in the [[Enemy Guide]]. If the stage is completed, there is a chance to unlock a new, unique [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] or [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] unit, as well as at least 3,800 XP, 30 [[Cat Food]] and 1 [[Leadership]] for the first victory. After beating an Advent Stage, an [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stage]] for the Cat unlocked in said stage will start to appear on the same dates. Beating these Awakening Stages can unlock new Advent Stages, unofficially dubbed '''Tier 2 Advent Stages''', with variants of bosses found in the originals.

Unlike the [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]]' drops, there is no unifying theme to the units obtained from these stages, but many of them are [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic]] or [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless]], which are relatively rare amongst non-[[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha]] units.

Certain Advent Stages also have an [[Abyssal Stage]] mode with additional rewards.

==Standard Advent Stages==
'''Standard Advent Stages''' were first introduced in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 4.7 Update|4.7]] with [[No Plan A (Deadly)|Clionel Ascendant]]. They contain only a single stage each, with a 30%-40% chance to drop an exclusive Rare or Super Rare Cat. In The Battle Cats Unite!, they were initially added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], but did not appear until the [[The_Battle_Cats_Unite!/Patch_1.0.7_Update#August_15,_2023_Update_Patch|August 15, 2023 Update Patch]] and are permanent stages.

All Standard Advent Stages have Energy Rush during [[Meownesday]] as of [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].
