==Great Advent Stages==
'''Great Advent Stages''' (大降臨ステージ ''Daikōrin Sutēji''), also known as '''Brutal Advent Stages''', were first introduced in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] with [[Reign of the Tyrant]]. These maps consist of four stages of different difficulties: most have one Deadly, two Merciless and one Brutal, while [[Invasion of Poultrio]] has three Merciless and one Brutal. The first three stages drop nothing, but the final stage has a 100% chance to drop an exclusive Rare Cat. All units dropped from Great Advent Stages have two targeted traits and at least one immunity.

All Great Advent Stages have Energy Rush during [[Meownesday]] as of [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].
