==Sequential Advent Stages==
'''Sequential Advent Stages''' (連続降臨ステージ ''Renzoku Kōrin Sutēji'') are a type of map first introduced in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]], appearing during (half) anniversary events. They consist of two consecutive Advent Stages: one normal, one [[Continuation Stage|continuation]].

Each Continuation Stage grants [[Catseye]]s as a one-time [[Catnip Challenges|mission]] reward. Tier 1 awards 3 Legend Catseyes, while Tier 2 awards 1 Dark Catseye.
