==Trivia==
*Clionel Ascendant, River Styx and Queen's Coronation are the only Advent Stages to drop [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]] instead of [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]. Since these three predate the introduction of [[Restriction Stage|restrictions]], it's possible that the later Advent drops all being Rare was done so they could be used in Level 4 [[Legend Stages]].
*Prior to February 2018, the first five Advent Stages had no known schedule.
**Deeply Dreaming had no known schedule until January 2019.
**Blue Impact, Courts of Torment, Papuu's Paradise and The Old Queen had no known recurring schedule until January 15th, 2020.
*Unlike the other Deadly Advent Stages, No Plan A's [[Stage Difficulties|star difficulty]] is only ★8, not ★9. This may be because it is the only Advent to have been added before [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]], meaning it was designed without power creep from [[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha cats]]' [[True Form]]s, [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]]' True Forms and [[Catseye]]s in mind.
*For all intents and purposes, [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Blue Impact]] is treated as a Deadly stage, despite Puffer Planet being labeled Merciless.
**Its [[Media:BlueImpact.jpg|event poster]] says, "Deadly Stage!"
**It is the only Merciless Advent Stage to award a gold [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]] rather than platinum.
**Its star difficulty is ★9 like most of the Deadly Advent Stages, rather than ★10 or ★11 like the Merciless ones.
**It is the only Merciless Advent Stage to be part of the limited [[Catnip Challenges]] that involve beating Advents with restrictions.
**It is the only Merciless Advent Stage to be part of a Tier 1 Sequential Advent Stage, appearing as a [[Continuation Stage]] in [[The Dead & The Bloated]].
**Puffsley's Comet is the only Merciless [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]] to appear in [[Heavenly Tower]] and [[Infernal Tower]], which otherwise only contain the Deadly Advent Bosses.
***The Merciless tag may be because of the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]' strength magnifications, as lowering them to meet the standards of a Deadly stage would have made it too easy with all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]].
*Z-Onel Rises! is currently the only initial Advent Stage in which the [[Death Angel Z-Onel|main enemy]] spawns multiple times and the only one where said enemy isn't a boss, as the boss shockwave is actually caused by a 10% [[Zoge]].
*[[Ghost King Finale (Brutal)|Ghost King Finale]] is currently the only Advent Stage to include two different Advent Bosses - [[Kappy Kawano]] and [[Kappy Jr.]]

